SUMMARY:Acoustic Sunsets at Sonoma Botanical Garden
DESCRIPTION:Acoustic Sunsets returns for its third season at Sonoma Botanical Garden in Glen Ellen. Every Wednesday evening from May through mid-September\, the Garden extends its hours and fills its outdoor amphitheater with live music by Bay Area musicians. Guests can bring picnics\, enjoy wine tastings with local Sonoma County vintners\, and unwind among the lush grounds. Well-behaved dogs on leash are welcome.    The series runs May 6 through September 16\, 2026\, with performances from 5:30 to 7:30 p.m. Admission is $17 for adults\, $14 for seniors\, and $8 for youth. Free for Garden members. New this year\, monthly Noche Latina nights celebrate Latin music and culture alongside a special exhibition of sculptural works.        Visit WebsiteEvent Tickets  
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/acoustic-sunsets-at-sonoma-botanical-garden-2/
LOCATION:12841 HWY 12, Glen Ellen, CA, 95442, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music,Music,Outdoors,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/04/01202458/SBG-AS-5-7-25-6024_web.jpg
END:VEVENT
