SUMMARY:Sips &amp; Succulents: Mother’s Day at Dutton Estate
DESCRIPTION:Sips &amp; Succulents: Mother’s Day at the Winery takes place May 9–10 from 11 AM – 4 PM\, offering a creative and memorable way to celebrate.    Guests can craft a custom succulent arrangement in a signature logo glass while enjoying a refreshing glass of wine or cider. Set against a blooming spring vineyard garden\, this relaxed experience blends creativity\, connection\, and celebration.    Each guest will create and take home their own unique succulent piece\, making it a meaningful keepsake. With a scenic backdrop and laid-back atmosphere\, it’s the perfect way to honor the moms in your life while enjoying wine country charm.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/sips-succulents-mothers-day-at-dutton-estate/
