SUMMARY:Mother's Day Brunch at El Dorado Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Mother’s Day at El Dorado Kitchen with a delicious brunch featuring fresh\, seasonal selections. Chef Armando Navarro brings a local twist to classic brunch favorites\, creating a menu perfect for honoring Mom.    Guests can enjoy a variety of thoughtfully prepared entrées\, while children under 12 have the option of an à la carte menu with kid-friendly choices like French toast\, house-made pasta\, pizza\, and chicken or fish.    Whether you’re gathering with family or treating Mom to something special\, this relaxed and flavorful brunch offers a memorable way to celebrate the day together.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/mothers-day-brunch-at-el-dorado-kitchen/
