SUMMARY:Mother’s Day Brunch at Santé Restaurant
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Mother’s Day in Sonoma with an indulgent brunch at Santé\, where seasonal flavors and Wine Country charm come together for a warm and memorable experience.    Guests can enjoy a thoughtfully curated menu highlighting fresh\, seasonal ingredients prepared with care\, all served in an elegant and inviting setting. Paired with the relaxed sophistication of Sonoma Wine Country\, this brunch offers the perfect opportunity to gather\, unwind\, and celebrate the special women in your life.    Whether sharing a leisurely meal with family or raising a toast to Mom\, Santé provides a beautiful backdrop for connection\, celebration\, and appreciation.
