SUMMARY:A Toast to Her: Yoga in the Vineyard at Gloria Ferrer
DESCRIPTION:A Toast to Her: Yoga in the Vineyard invites guests to celebrate Mother’s Day weekend with a peaceful morning at Willow Springs\, surrounded by scenic vineyard views.    This experience begins with an all-levels yoga flow led by an experienced instructor\, designed to restore\, relax\, and reconnect. Following the session\, guests are invited to enjoy a celebratory sparkling wine toast\, adding a touch of indulgence to the serene setting.    Perfect for honoring the occasion\, this event blends movement\, mindfulness\, and meaningful connection in a beautiful wine country environment.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/a-toast-to-her-yoga-in-the-vineyard-at-gloria-ferrer-winery/
