SUMMARY:Mother's Day at Bees N Blooms
DESCRIPTION:Mother’s Day at Bees N Blooms invites guests to celebrate surrounded by the beauty of blooming gardens and peaceful farm life.    Bring Mom for a relaxing picnic-style experience in the Pavilion\, nestled among vibrant flowers and buzzing pollinators. Guests can wander the Lavender Labyrinth\, explore the Flower and Butterfly Gardens\, and enjoy the fresh spring air while capturing memorable photos.    Visit the nursery for organic\, pollinator-friendly plants or browse the farm stand for lavender products. Admission to the farm is free\, with reserved tables available for small groups\, offering a comfortable space to gather and unwind.    With limited availability\, this charming outdoor experience is a perfect way to celebrate Mother’s Day in a serene and scenic setting.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/mothers-day-at-bees-n-blooms/
LOCATION:3883 Petaluma Hill Road, Santa Rosa, CA, 95404, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Family Friendly,Food,Holiday,Outdoors,Sonoma County
