SUMMARY:Mother’s Day Brunch at Spoonbar
DESCRIPTION:This Mother’s Day\, celebrate Mom at Spoonbar with a delicious festive brunch featuring everything from classic Eggs Benedict to hand-carved\, roasted Prime New York Strip.    Highlights include Bread Pudding French Toast with Vermont maple syrup\, spring berries\, and Chantilly cream; Slow Roasted Salmon with crispy Brussels sprouts and beurre fondue; Chilled English Pea and Yukon Gold Potato Soup with lemon crème fraiche and Aleppo pepper; and Assorted Macarons and Mini Eclairs.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/mothers-day-brunch-at-spoonbar/
