SUMMARY:Mother's Day Brunch at Orsi Family Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Mother’s Day Brunch at Orsi Family Vineyards invites guests to celebrate with a relaxed\, Italian-style gathering at their family winery in Healdsburg.    Enjoy a curated brunch paired with four featured wines: Sparkling Biancolella\, Fiano\, Nebbiolo\, and Sangiovese while soaking in a warm\, welcoming atmosphere. Guests are encouraged to bring the mother figures in their lives or anyone they cherish and share a joyful afternoon together.    With delicious bites\, great wine\, and live music\, this festive brunch offers a perfect way to honor Mother’s Day in true Italian style. Tickets are limited\, so early reservations are recommended.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/mothers-day-brunch-at-orsi-family-vineyards/
LOCATION:2306 Magnolia Dr , Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
